{"body_markdown":"","change_reason":"按已审稿的独立技术单元和双文档结构保存可读研究内容","content_hash":"48b6a9da66b4bb67f51fbe18056169126f9eaea816f5c1513c6c5a0324b788b8","created_at":"2026-09-09T06:32:34.154111Z","created_by":{"id":"codex-approved-v3-report-author","kind":"ai"},"discovery":"workspace_summary","keywords":["浮点求和","顺序敏感","补偿","有限构造输入"],"kind":"document_section","level":null,"owner_id":"RES-FLOATING-POINT-SUMMATION","payload":{"blocks":[{"evidence_refs":[{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"c9ab320069397e5219eca068d85e33fd7636368db676026a7f9d3f1f68863c20","target_id":"MEM-c52df8fb-ca9e-53a7-a49b-342592884a50","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"f622c9730e82aa63f77c098592809f4aef8b601cfe747931c42974de741ad9cd","target_id":"MEM-c4a61c00-1bf1-59b3-a65e-0fa4847db2e1","target_kind":"record"},{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":3,"sha256":"4e863128333d48e4bb228682a3664fbabd1155143bc92db2d6a1d1b50db6cf86","target_id":"MEM-96f79923-f023-509e-a002-40f2d5a4fca1","target_kind":"record"}],"markdown":"本研究检验输入顺序如何影响有限精度求和，以及补偿算法能否避免所选抵消结构中的小量损失。三轮均使用人为构造的无量纲整数浮点输入；结果相对于实际binary64输入的精确有理数和核对。“精确命中”表示绝对误差恰为0，不使用浮点容差。\n\n比较方法为保存脚本中的显式逐项累加、Kahan、Neumaier及math.fsum。第一轮只比较逐项累加和math.fsum；后两轮比较四种方法。独立方法章节给出变量、递推、基准和方法边界，完整研究过程保留输入、逐步状态、完整结果和图表。","type":"prose"},{"block_ids":["reference"],"ref":{"locator":"完整正文与固定依据","relation":"references","revision":1,"sha256":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b60c7f082ee9113e419572834df51","target_id":"MEM-4acc73bb-59c7-560d-9415-fd42e9dcaa2d","target_kind":"record"},"type":"unit"}],"missing_refs":[],"role":"methods","section_key":"brief-methods","title":"研究问题与方法","watch_refs":[{"baseline_record_hash":"ba12342c6ca8afa0a1760dc517fd7bff2d1b6